{"id":"n23995-1-8","stage":5,"title":"관습 · 旧习","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n23995-1-8-1","ko":"한국에서는 이사를 하면 이웃에 떡을 돌린다면서요?","zh":"我听说在韩国搬家的话要给邻居送年糕对吧？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"한국에서는","meaning":"韩国","explanation":"한국：韩国；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"한국에서는","audio":"/audio/0fda1025e73ae0560e48.mp3"}],"sources":[]},{"text":"이사를","meaning":"搬家","explanation":"이사：搬家；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"이사","audio":"/audio/925efb171a8616ccc70a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71138","senseId":"1","lemma":"이사","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"하면","meaning":"因为，由于","explanation":"하다：因为，由于；면：表示条件或假设：“如果、若、……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"18","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"이웃에","meaning":"邻居，邻里","explanation":"이웃：邻居，邻里；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"이웃","audio":"/audio/56a0fd1527d122372c76.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31487","senseId":"2","lemma":"이웃","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"떡을","meaning":"糕，糕饼，糕点","explanation":"떡：糕，糕饼，糕点；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"떡","audio":"/audio/f7ea97e270cc40ef971e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20199","senseId":"1","lemma":"떡","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"돌린다면서요?","meaning":"分给，分送","explanation":"돌리다：分给，分送；ㄴ다면서：引用所听到的内容，连接后文的评论、确认或对照。；요：增加礼貌语气。","readings":[{"term":"돌리다","audio":"/audio/6d22f9fa2b8915ddd6fa.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71457","senseId":"8","lemma":"돌리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"925efb171a8616cc","term":"이사","zh":"搬家","audio":"/audio/925efb171a8616ccc70a.mp3","entryId":"71138","definition":"离开原先生活的地方，搬去别的地方。","pronunciation":["이사"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"因为，由于","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"表示原因。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"56a0fd1527d12237","term":"이웃","zh":"邻居，邻里","audio":"/audio/56a0fd1527d122372c76.mp3","entryId":"31487","definition":"与自己的家邻近的家；或居住在那个房子里的人。","pronunciation":["이욷"]},{"id":"f7ea97e270cc40ef","term":"떡","zh":"糕，糕饼，糕点","audio":"/audio/f7ea97e270cc40ef971e.mp3","entryId":"20199","definition":"类似于打糕、松糕，将谷物磨成的粉蒸熟或煮熟后制成的食物。","pronunciation":["떡"]},{"id":"6d22f9fa2b8915dd","term":"돌리다","zh":"分给，分送","audio":"/audio/6d22f9fa2b8915ddd6fa.mp3","entryId":"71457","definition":"分发或配送东西等。","pronunciation":["돌리다"]}],"audio":"/audio/a8f3f7291c42829bd262.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n23995-1-8-2","ko":"네. 떡을 돌리면서 이웃과 인사를 나누는 관습이 있지요.","zh":"是的。有通过送年糕来和邻居互相打招呼的习俗呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"네.","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"네：是，行","readings":[{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17294","senseId":"2","lemma":"네","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"떡을","meaning":"糕，糕饼，糕点","explanation":"떡：糕，糕饼，糕点；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"떡","audio":"/audio/f7ea97e270cc40ef971e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20199","senseId":"1","lemma":"떡","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"돌리면서","meaning":"分给，分送","explanation":"돌리다：分给，分送；면서：表示同时进行或并列；与 도 合用可表示“同时却、尽管”。","readings":[{"term":"돌리다","audio":"/audio/6d22f9fa2b8915ddd6fa.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71457","senseId":"8","lemma":"돌리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"이웃과","meaning":"邻居，邻里","explanation":"이웃：邻居，邻里；과：连接共同参与或比较的对象，常表示“和、与”；结合句中动作理解。","readings":[{"term":"이웃","audio":"/audio/56a0fd1527d122372c76.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31487","senseId":"2","lemma":"이웃","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"인사를","meaning":"问候，打招呼","explanation":"인사：问候，打招呼；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"인사","audio":"/audio/ae353e9482abc103f0f3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66311","senseId":"1","lemma":"인사","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"나누는","meaning":"交流，交换，交谈","explanation":"나누다：交流，交换，交谈；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"나누다","audio":"/audio/8a88d2ae9895b06ef350.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29749","senseId":"6","lemma":"나누다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"관습이","meaning":"旧习，老规矩，常规，成规","explanation":"관습：旧习，老规矩，常规，成规；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"관습","audio":"/audio/1cac66d9c23b1260662e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"23995","senseId":"1","lemma":"관습","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"있지요.","meaning":"有","explanation":"있다：有；지요：礼貌地确认、提醒或表达意愿；죠 是 지요 的缩略。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"2","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"1c0ddfd005093840","term":"네","zh":"是，行","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3","entryId":"17294","definition":"用于肯定回答长辈所提出的问题或命令等。","pronunciation":["네"]},{"id":"f7ea97e270cc40ef","term":"떡","zh":"糕，糕饼，糕点","audio":"/audio/f7ea97e270cc40ef971e.mp3","entryId":"20199","definition":"类似于打糕、松糕，将谷物磨成的粉蒸熟或煮熟后制成的食物。","pronunciation":["떡"]},{"id":"6d22f9fa2b8915dd","term":"돌리다","zh":"分给，分送","audio":"/audio/6d22f9fa2b8915ddd6fa.mp3","entryId":"71457","definition":"分发或配送东西等。","pronunciation":["돌리다"]},{"id":"56a0fd1527d12237","term":"이웃","zh":"邻居，邻里","audio":"/audio/56a0fd1527d122372c76.mp3","entryId":"31487","definition":"与自己的家邻近的家；或居住在那个房子里的人。","pronunciation":["이욷"]},{"id":"ae353e9482abc103","term":"인사","zh":"问候，打招呼","audio":"/audio/ae353e9482abc103f0f3.mp3","entryId":"66311","definition":"见面或告别时表现地有礼节，或指那样的言行。","pronunciation":["인사"]},{"id":"8a88d2ae9895b06e","term":"나누다","zh":"交流，交换，交谈","audio":"/audio/8a88d2ae9895b06ef350.mp3","entryId":"29749","definition":"互相说话、谈论或问候等。","pronunciation":["나누다"]},{"id":"1cac66d9c23b1260","term":"관습","zh":"旧习，老规矩，常规，成规","audio":"/audio/1cac66d9c23b1260662e.mp3","entryId":"23995","definition":"一个社会里，长期以来一直遵守的社会规范或生活方式。","pronunciation":["관습"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"有","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"68797","definition":"事实或现象存在。","pronunciation":["읻따"]}],"audio":"/audio/b913199f97b323396f72.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.18,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=23995","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":152,"sequenceScore":3.0067,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["我听说在韩国搬家的话要给邻居送年糕对吧？","是的。有通过送年糕来和邻居互相打招呼的习俗呢。","在这里看书可以吗？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["我听说在韩国搬家的话要给邻居送年糕对吧？","是的。有通过送年糕来和邻居互相打招呼的习俗呢。","在这里看书可以吗？"],"answer":1}]}
